flowchart TD

    A[Raw Battery Dataset] --> B[Data Preprocessing]

    B --> B1[Data Cleaning]
    B1 --> B2[Feature Selection]
    B2 --> B3[Feature Scaling]
    B3 --> B4[SoH and RUL Target Construction]

    B4 --> C[Chronological Sequence Generation]

    C --> C1[Sequence Length = 10]
    C1 --> C2[Input Shape = 10 × 4]

    C2 --> D[Dataset Partitioning]

    D --> D1[Training Set<br/>955 Sequences]
    D --> D2[Validation Set<br/>138 Sequences]
    D --> D3[Test Set<br/>84 Sequences]

    D1 --> E[Model Training]
    D2 --> E

    E --> F1[Baseline LSTM]
    E --> F2[Proposed PI-GLSTM]

    F1 --> G1[LSTM Temporal Representation]
    G1 --> G2[Dense Layer]
    G2 --> G3[SoH + RUL Prediction]

    F2 --> H1[LSTM Temporal Representation]
    H1 --> H2[Physics-Informed Degradation Mechanism]
    H2 --> H3[Non-Negative Degradation Increment]
    H3 --> H4[Cumulative Degradation]
    H4 --> H5[Monotonic SoH Trajectory]
    H5 --> H6[SoH + RUL Prediction]

    G3 --> I[Model Selection]
    H6 --> I

    I --> I1[Training / Validation Loss]
    I1 --> I2[Best Validation Checkpoint]
    I2 --> J[Test Set Evaluation]

    D3 --> J

    J --> K[Inverse Target Transformation]

    K --> L[Performance Evaluation]

    L --> L1[MAE]
    L --> L2[RMSE]
    L --> L3[R²]
    L --> L4[MAPE]

    L --> M[Physical Consistency Evaluation]

    M --> M1[SoH Monotonicity]
    M1 --> M2[Violation Rate]
    M2 --> M3[Monotonicity Score]
    M3 --> M4[Upward Movement Analysis]

    L --> N[Comparative Analysis]
    M --> N

    N --> N1[Baseline LSTM]
    N --> N2[Proposed PI-GLSTM]

    N1 --> O[Accuracy vs Physical Consistency]
    N2 --> O

    O --> P[Interpretation of Results]
    P --> Q[Implications for Battery Prognostics]